      "content": "it's just so much pressure to keep \"recovering\" when there's nothing left to recover. like i'm just running on empty and everyone expects me to keep running. sometimes it feels like the only real way to stop the cycle is to just stop trying entirely. to just accept that i can't be fixed and stop fighting it. do you think it's okay to just... let go?",
